  "translated_count": 20,
  "entries": [
    {"uid":"zhcn:5cb99fdcb1d1d685b990337e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"原来只是轻咬喔──！？","source_fingerprint":"e60ace147c11c3476480739140c9a8da01bd07573b4b4074d97d7f2ad899e647","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","140017"],"entry_index":20,"target_text":"Hóa ra chỉ cắn nhẹ thôi──!?","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:e81a6f559fa795380f88e77f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"太失望啦──！","source_fingerprint":"ce41a0c25e93e12a5612f0f58343b93bb5ea2f520f0744b6662689b854f9752c","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","140018"],"entry_index":21,"target_text":"Thất vọng quá──!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:78e7507536f143ca1a1d5bbb","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"明天就给你这个吧。","source_fingerprint":"921bb110a639e5407c870c930577539fc22d85fb949b0d1edcf5015d10d950fe","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","15"],"entry_index":22,"target_text":"Ngày mai sẽ cho bạn cái này.","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:b79835248839693e35ebd332","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风不要训练！\r\n要～休～息～啦～！！","source_fingerprint":"a2d21ee0bd8c710f35d3852f642a99990f7f85b6b7d02ccb3fce2b41d02e9fc1","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20000"],"entry_index":23,"target_text":"Windy không muốn training!\r\nMuốn～nghỉ～cơ～!!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:92d58b0b1a050c39aadbe02f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"训练员……你好像比风风\r\n更有精神喔……太嚣张了喔……！","source_fingerprint":"0600582ef3b26cf3ac15597e9cf97d7d841d998e266734e1ffe197a2bed8c199","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20001"],"entry_index":24,"target_text":"Trainer… trông bạn còn\r\nsung sức hơn Windy… láo xược thật đấy…!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:9a5c42d2503523f6ecd529e4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"今天的风风跟平常不太一样，\r\n不，是很不一样喔！！","source_fingerprint":"9ae54c006bd88bfe5984dc1949e9dac709489acccceee0bc98295c66ad5da01f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20002"],"entry_index":25,"target_text":"Windy hôm nay hơi khác ngày thường,\r\nkhông, khác hẳn luôn!!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:591ae89e453f621a4741f538","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"看啊！这副利齿！\r\n闪闪发光的喔～！","source_fingerprint":"fa49939bba513650d2a948fc417ca295561216ca1854ffeb460dfc7cebdbbe6b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20003"],"entry_index":26,"target_text":"Nhìn này! Hàm răng sắc bén!\r\nSáng lấp lánh luôn～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:7bff9eb199475cb6b107486d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风可是丢下功课\r\n立～刻赶来你身边的喔！\r\n快感谢风风吧～♪","source_fingerprint":"244260f6025d13d3746ff949083b675f83c2bb4a8e7c96f79aedad332c1f5532","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20004"],"entry_index":27,"target_text":"Windy bỏ cả bài tập\r\nđể lập～tức chạy tới bên bạn đấy!\r\nMau cảm ơn Windy đi～♪","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:b58425c57cb52ebdb7f2fd7a","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要是这家伙\r\n掉进这个地洞陷阱……\r\n噗噗噗，一定很好笑喔！","source_fingerprint":"759885cf22cfbc7e743ad5bce63ebc6114b4a245dfc846bce5613c6b0ed53fac","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20005"],"entry_index":28,"target_text":"Nếu tên này\r\nrơi vào cái bẫy hố này…\r\npupupu, chắc chắn buồn cười lắm!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:fcf80b1533b2fb7c7aed7621","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风早就做完伸展运动了喔。\r\n事前准备很重要，\r\n风风有在恶作剧所以非常清楚喔！","source_fingerprint":"5312841117ee6cf9f408eee624b2dcc58b9e119bee7c229cb6c93d1163de0c8a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20006"],"entry_index":29,"target_text":"Windy giãn cơ xong từ lâu rồi.\r\nChuẩn bị trước rất quan trọng,\r\nWindy hay nghịch phá nên biết rõ lắm!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:4029989192558986f4a8b413","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要是敢排些无聊的行程，\r\n风风就要惩罚你喔！","source_fingerprint":"995db53074f980fbf1548cbf4382aebedcb08afc571189057df77ea330d6e636","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20007"],"entry_index":30,"target_text":"Nếu dám xếp lịch chán ngắt,\r\nWindy sẽ phạt bạn đó!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:57a662a7c75d9c7b1be3e137","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"讨厌讨厌讨厌！\r\n这样下去根本\r\n没人会注目风风啦～！","source_fingerprint":"709a0aa226efd07d83c8c57d4be3a8ffaec82c9feb6a8addee91da6da3dc1f74","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20008"],"entry_index":31,"target_text":"Ghét ghét ghét!\r\nCứ thế này thì\r\nchẳng ai chú ý đến Windy đâu～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:93630cfa21bad11942565f0c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好无聊！风风想来点有趣的！\r\n有趣的～有趣的啦～～！！","source_fingerprint":"2f9d13295abf803968cffa08b6638d7cc98ef9e542078e399290368bbab8b6b5","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20009"],"entry_index":32,"target_text":"Chán quá! Windy muốn thứ gì vui cơ!\r\nVui～ vui cơ mà～～!!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:44e0162b07a64349371b25d0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"身体……感觉，好重喔……\r\n好怪喔……","source_fingerprint":"6ad2f4b95c548ec519e4bd4fdec744d36d4c42f9731e299812f00d9e8e40c51b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20010"],"entry_index":33,"target_text":"Cơ thể… cảm giác nặng quá…\r\nlạ thật…","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:eb4895e680c6eec8fbf347f6","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风不想被觉得很逊！\r\n绝对不能被小看喔～！","source_fingerprint":"20bc715d904e3e2de427dfb726ff972b87df9cb024a58a4637132277ab5ba40f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20011"],"entry_index":34,"target_text":"Windy không muốn bị nghĩ là cùi!\r\nTuyệt đối không được để bị xem thường～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:bd8de8063cec3b70216a4407","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"又要比赛啊？\r\n风风开始觉得腻了啦～","source_fingerprint":"c4a556ccb9bfeef3c0ea89572394368756e4cad0cd47b788df64b7b3b349cbcc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20021"],"entry_index":35,"target_text":"Lại phải race nữa à?\r\nWindy bắt đầu chán rồi～","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:fcf610d8318cfc0897c668cb","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"唔啊──！风风不要比赛啦！\r\n不要就是不要啦～～！","source_fingerprint":"b192201338bf4c86b3f905c82dd70d24fe92d824327057a18ee71cf26797c6ec","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20022"],"entry_index":36,"target_text":"Uwaa──! Windy không muốn race đâu!\r\nKhông muốn là không muốn～～!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:65d88d8f5772f243188185ca","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"风风就是最强的～！\r\n最强的就是风风～！\r\n吼──！！","source_fingerprint":"c3e75ce0495e6b99053829671a6ef14375769e0ef34aa4444a15b2411e3c99ae","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20023"],"entry_index":37,"target_text":"Windy là mạnh nhất～!\r\nMạnh nhất chính là Windy～!\r\nGào──!!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:4420a036bb4061c28db36a6d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"今天会让你们牢牢记住\r\n风风的实力！","source_fingerprint":"bfdff22c40e546e1f666ac20a5d11a93abc3accbb7da1d83ef9b6047d279da44","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20024"],"entry_index":38,"target_text":"Hôm nay Windy sẽ khiến các ngươi nhớ thật kỹ\r\nthực lực của Windy!","reviewed":true},
    {"uid":"zhcn:bbf818adb91187fb2672a86e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"今天风风也要\r\n独占所有人的注意喔！","source_fingerprint":"49b9ad528a5a49635cd3c6066a44ee387aa50f6424ed04e6d90717427f95d04e","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1043","20025"],"entry_index":39,"target_text":"Hôm nay Windy cũng sẽ\r\nđộc chiếm mọi ánh nhìn!","reviewed":true}
  ]
}
